{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"推出 (一种余极限)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"推出"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>推出是以\n$$\r\n\\bullet \\leftarrow \\bullet \\rightarrow \\bullet\r\n$$\n为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":", 是"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":"的对偶.</p>\n<h3>同伦类型论</h3>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, 对于类型 $X,Y$ 以及 $Q\\colon X\\to Y \\to\\mathsf{Type}$, 定义推出 $X \\sqcup_Q Y$ 为如下"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶归纳类型","text":"高阶归纳类型"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf{left} \\colon X \\to X\\sqcup_Q Y$</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{right} \\colon Y \\to X\\sqcup_Q Y$</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{glue}\\colon \\prod_{x\\colon X}\\prod_{y\\colon Y} Q(x,y) \\to (\\mathsf{left}\\,x =\\mathsf{right}\\,y)$</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}